\frac{2}{3 a^{2} b^{2} c^{2}} \geq 9+\frac{a+b+c}{a b c}, \quad \text { i.e. } \quad 27 a^{2} b^{2} c^{2}+3 a b c(a+b+c) \leq 2 \tag{2}
