\begin{aligned}
& \sqrt{a^{2}+(1-b)^{2}}+\sqrt{b^{2}+(1-c)^{2}}+\sqrt{c^{2}+(1-a)^{2}} \\
& \quad \geq \sqrt{(a+b+c)^{2}+(3-a-b-c)^{2}}=\sqrt{2\left(a+b+c-\frac{3}{2}\right)^{2}+\frac{9}{2}} \geq \frac{3 \sqrt{2}}{2}
