From the obvious inequality
$$
(a b-1)^{2}+(b c-1)^{2}+(c a-1)^{2} \geq 0
$$
we deduce that
$$
\begin{equation*}
6+2\left(a^{2} b^{2}+b^{2} c^{2}+c^{2} a^{2}\right) \geq 4(a b+a c+b c) \tag{2}
