$$

Then
$$
\begin{align*}
2 S= & (a+b+c+d+e+f)^{2} \\
& -\left(a^{2}+b^{2}+c^{2}+d^{2}+e^{2}+f^{2}+2 a d+2 b d+2 c f\right) \tag{2}
