\frac{1}{x}+\frac{1}{y}-4(x+y) & =(x+y)\left(\frac{1}{x y}-4\right) \geq \frac{2}{2 z+1}(2 z+1) \\
& =\frac{2(2 z-1)(2 z+3)}{2 z+1}=4 z-\frac{1}{z}+\frac{(2 z-1)^{2}}{z(2 z+1)}
