From (2) and (3) we get
$4\left(x^{9}+y^{9}\right)=2 \cdot 2\left(x^{9}+y^{9}\right) \geq 2\left(x^{5}+y^{5}\right)\left(x^{4}+y^{4}\right) \geq\left(x^{2}+y^{2}\right)\left(x^{3}+y^{3}\right)\left(x^{4}+y^{4}\right)$,
