Assume that $a \geq b \geq c$. Then
$$
a^{2} \geq b^{2} \geq c^{2} \quad \text { and } \quad \frac{1}{b+c} \geq \frac{1}{c+a} \geq \frac{1}{a+b}
$$

Applying Chebishev's inequality and $A M \geq H M$ we get
