$$
1-q+\frac{8(2 q+1)(2 q-1)}{81} \geq \frac{8}{27}
$$
which is equivalent to
$$
(1-q)(49-32 q) \geq 0
$$
which clearly holds, due to (4). Therefore, the answer is (B) $\geq$.

