& \frac{x^{2}-z^{2}}{y+z}+\frac{y^{2}-x^{2}}{z+x}+\frac{z^{2}-y^{2}}{x+y} \\
& \quad=\frac{a c}{b}+\frac{b a}{c}+\frac{c b}{a}-(a+b+c) \geq(a+b+c)-(a+b+c)=0
