$$
i.e.
$$
\frac{1}{\sqrt{(x+y)(x+z)}} \leq \frac{1}{\sqrt{x z}+\sqrt{x y}}=\frac{1}{\sqrt{x}(\sqrt{y}+\sqrt{z})}
