\left(\sum_{i=1}^{n} \frac{1}{a_{i}^{2}+x^{2}}\right)^{2} \leqslant & \left(\sum_{i=1}^{n} \frac{1}{a_{i}}\right)\left(\sum_{i=1}^{n} \frac{a_{i}}{\left(a_{i}^{2}+x^{2}\right)^{2}}\right) \leqslant \\
& \sum_{i=1}^{n} \frac{a^{i}}{\left(a_{i}^{2}+x^{2}\right)^{2}}
\end{aligned}
$$

For positive integers $a_{1}<a_{2}<\cdots<a_{n}$, we have $a_{i+1} \geqslant a_{i}+1, i=1$, $2, \cdots, n-1$, and
